Package: nspawn
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd-container, iproute2, nftables
Description: Docker-like management of systemd-nspawn machines
 nspawn pulls OCI images from a registry, keeps them as shared layers, and
 runs them as systemd-nspawn machines with a bridge network, published ports
 and volumes, driven over the D-Bus APIs of systemd and machined. The work
 is done by a service on the system bus, org.nspawn; the command line is its
 client.
